The simple-websocket-server port provides headers under the
<simple-websocket-server/...> include path.

For the v2.0.2 headers, define USE_STANDALONE_ASIO before including a
Simple-WebSocket-Server header to use standalone Asio. This is the public
compile definition used by that upstream release; it is distinct from the
upstream CMake option with the same name. The default installation includes
the standalone Asio dependency. Install the `boost-asio` feature when the
definition is omitted and Boost.Asio is used.
